            0.694,
            0.162
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Which of the following are environment-friendly practices?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.165,
            0.724,
            0.184
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) Carrying cloth-bags to put purchases in while shopping",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.186,
            0.598,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) Switching off unnecessary lights and fans",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.207,
            0.893,
            0.227
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) Walking to school instead of getting your mother to drop you on her scooter",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.229,
            0.369,
            0.247
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) All of the above",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.25,
            0.751,
            0.269
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. What will happen if we kill all the organisms in one trophic level?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.271,
            0.893,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Will the impact of removing all the organisms in a trophic level be different for different trophic levels? Can the organisms of any trophic level be removed without causing any damage to the ecosystem?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.328,
            0.892,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. What is biological magnification? Will the levels of this magnification be different at different levels of the ecosystem?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.366,
            0.893,
            0.385
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. What are the problems caused by the non-biodegradable wastes that we generate?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.388,
            0.892,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. If all the waste we generate is biodegradable, will this have no impact on the environment?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.426,
            0.892,
            0.462
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. Why is damage to the ozone layer a cause for concern? What steps are being taken to limit this damage?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 13,
